# Manual Support Ticket Creation Flow

This diagram covers how a user manually submits a support ticket and how the microservice manages its lifecycle.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Web Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Support Microservice
    participant AUTH as User Management
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EMAIL as Email Service

    U->>C: Submit Support Form (Subject + Message)
    C->>API: POST /support/tickets
    API->>AUTH: Validate User JWT
    AUTH-->>API: User Validated
    API->>SVC: Forward Ticket Request
    SVC->>DB: Insert SupportTicket (status=OPEN)
    DB-->>SVC: Ticket Created
    SVC->>EMAIL: Notify Support Team (New Ticket)
    EMAIL-->>SVC: Email Sent (status=SENT)
    SVC->>DB: Update EmailLog
    SVC-->>API: Response 201 (Ticket Created)
    API-->>C: Confirmation to User
